@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Druclad Mixamo clips
+
+Preferred workflow:
+
+1. Upload `../Druclad_MixamoRigged.fbx` to Mixamo.
+2. Download the kit listed in `DrucladAnimCatalog` as **FBX for Unity (with skin)**.
+3. Drop the FBXs into this folder using the preferred filenames from the catalog
+   (`Monster Idle.fbx`, `Roaring.fbx`, `Jump Attack.fbx`, etc.).
+4. In Unity run **Manafall → Creatures → Setup Druclad** (or Animations Only).
+   That retargets every clip onto the Druclad Humanoid avatar and rebuilds
+   `Assets/Animation/Druclad.controller`.
+
+Until dedicated Mixamo downloads land here, Setup copies the closest project
+Mixamo fallbacks (skeleton / samurai packs) into this folder automatically.
